      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CONOR FIRE (1) box seated before sticking on well to finish 0.8 lengths away in second (20.56) at this track in a Maiden over 366m. Expected to feature in the finish again. HELLO ARLO (8) is a first starter from the Garry Gilbert yard by Tommy Shelby out of She's Whistling. Start all important and will need some luck getting across from the wide draw. Has a nice profile and expected to measure up at first outing. HARA'S ANCHOR (7) has been in super consistent form recently with two minors on end before missing the frame latest finishing fifth (20.33) at this track. The form from his last run is stacking up nicely. Cannot be taken lightly. STACK OF DREAMS (3) cannot be left out despite racing here for the first time.",
